```mdl
decision D-69: The extensions are the spec's dialects. Plugins contribute the dialects a spec can use as `ProjectCapabilities.SpecDialect`, and the Extensions menu lists them and checks the ones in `Spec.dialects`. This plugin contributes the features dialect, `org.dxos.spec.features`, from the module that contributes its editor extensions. Fills in [D-65] and [D-67].
