```mdl
decision D-80: Plugins contribute packages as `ProjectCapabilities.SpecPackage`, each an id, a label and its dialects, in place of `ProjectCapabilities.SpecDialect`. The software package holds the features, app, plugin, QA and SQL dialects (`FeatureMap.SOFTWARE_DIALECTS`). The Extensions menu checks a package when the spec uses all its dialects; checking adds the missing ones and unchecking removes them all. Fills in [D-76].
