```mdl
decision D-81: Adding a feature to a spec, from the canvas, `/feature`, an operation or a file read in, gives it the whole software package. `FeatureMap.make` makes a spec with the package, and the `Spec` 0.2.0 migration gives it to every spec it migrates. Fills in [D-76].
  date: 2026-10-30
  by: agent:claude-code
