```mdl
decision D-82: A package's editor extensions contribute slash commands to the `slashCommand` facet, and one completion lists every contributed command. `blockTemplate` makes a command that writes a fenced `mdl` block with its fields empty, numbered after the blocks with its prefix, and text before the slash becomes its title. The software package adds `/type`, `/op`, `/scenario` (`T-n`), `/test` (`QA-n`) and `/table`. An editor rebuilds its extensions from the dialects it renders. Fills in [D-78] and [D-79].
  date: 2026-10-30
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-4.10, F-2.6]
  why: One completion keeps every package's commands in one list, and numbering after the existing blocks keeps ids unique in the text.
  rejected:
