```

```mdl
decision D-83: The plus shows in the empty cell under the pointer, anywhere on the grid, and stays while its menu is open. It opens a menu of New feature and Add existing feature, which place the feature in that cell, first fixing every card where it is drawn, since a new card changes the automatic layout's extent. The canvas shows even when the spec holds no features. Fills in [D-77].
