```mdl
decision D-98: Before the migration deletes a held document, it finds every object that refers to the document and points each such ref, in a top-level field or a list of refs, at the spec. It does this through references in the database, not a list of the types that may link a document, so plugin-projects needs no knowledge of code projects. Fills in [D-97].
