```mdl
decision D-101: Another plugin nests levels beneath a spec with `ProjectGraph.makeLevelNode`, and a level opens as the project article narrowed to it through the `ProjectView.Level` surface, with the nesting plugin's `ProjectView.LevelOverview` surface as its Overview. The project a level belongs to is the nearest project among its ECHO parents. Fills in [D-99].
