```mdl
decision D-109: QA-4 assigns a task from its row's placeholder, has a coding session claim a task through `tasks-update`, and checks that selection checkboxes show on hover until one is ticked. "Assign to agent" is "Delegate to agent" throughout. Fills in [D-105] to [D-107].
