```mdl
decision D-125: Any finish without a person's sign-off lands in review when a person answers for the task, before or after the edit; only an agent's own task closes on its done. Fills in [D-123] and [D-124].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  why: A write cannot tell an agent from a person, and a person's own done already signs off through AcceptTask. Gating on the delegate alone let an agent clear it and then finish.
