```mdl
decision D-132: A coding session's claim (`tasks-update` with `remoteSession`) names its person only on a task nobody answers for yet. On a task with a person assignee, a different person is ignored; clearing the assignee or naming an agent is refused. Fills in [D-124].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  why: A session passes the person it works for on every claim, so a claim on someone else's task reassigned it and sent its finish to the wrong reviewer.
