```mdl
decision D-133: A delegate must be an agent (`role: assistant`). Naming the task's own assignee as delegate stays allowed, since that hands the task back. Fills in [D-124].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  why: A person stored as delegate drew an agent badge on a task no agent works, and the supervisor and review gate read the field as an agent.
