```mdl
decision D-134: A session's check-in lists only its unfinished tasks: a task in review waits on its person, not on the session. Fills in [D-123].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  why: Every finish a person answers for lands in review, so the reminder of open work listed finished tasks until someone signed them off.
```

```mdl
decision D-135: Any agent claim, a coding session's or an edit naming an agent as delegate, names its person only on a task nobody answers for yet; a session's delegate is always stored as an agent. Supersedes [D-132] and fills in [D-133].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
