```mdl
decision D-136: A request for a sub-agent is exactly `{ role: 'assistant' }`, one predicate (`Task.isSubAgentRequest`) read by the supervisor and the planning tool's unassign. An agent named by a session, identity or contact is a concrete delegate. Fills in [D-125].
