```mdl
decision D-144: An agent claim on a task a person answers for keeps that person and ignores a different person the edit names, for a direct delegate edit as for a session; the operation description says so, and a reassignment goes in its own edit. Fills in [D-142].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
