```mdl
decision D-146: Delegating a task to a chat (`DelegateTaskToChat`) and the planning tool's claim each give a step with no assignee the nearest person up its tree; the delegating person fills in only where the tree has nobody. Fills in [D-140].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
