```

```mdl
decision D-147: The planning tool's claim gives the nearest person up the tree to a step another agent was left holding, as every other claim does; only a task the conversation made for itself is left as it is. Fills in [D-146].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
