```mdl
decision D-148: Who a step answers to is `Task.owner`, with no second helper: a step with no person of its own takes its parent's `Task.owner`, which the stored rule has already written there.
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: user:wittjosiah
  supersedes: D-140
