```mdl
decision D-149: Where [D-141], [D-142], [D-146] and [D-147] give a step the nearest person up its tree, each now gives it its parent's person. The claim cascade still runs root first, so a member reads a parent it has just written; a member whose parent has no person takes the claim's person. Fills in [D-148].
