```

```mdl
decision D-153: The migration takes the first person among a task's reviewers, drops the reviewers of a task a person is assigned, and takes a 0.5.0 task straight to 0.7.0 with the same conversion. It runs before the 0.5.0 pass, so that pass finds every migrated task at 0.7.0. Fills in [D-152].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [Task]
