```mdl
decision D-177: react-ui-form's field override takes `appearance: 'section'` for an array, which renders the array as a section of its own with its label as the heading and its add button in the heading's actions. A form's array rows drop the list row's leading inset, so a row's fields start on the section's edge. Fills in [D-173] and [D-174].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
