```

```mdl
decision D-183: react-ui-form's field `appearance` folds into its presentation. `title`, `plain` and `section` are presentations, a field override takes a `presentation` of its own in place of the form's layout, and `title` and `plain` hide the field's label, so the overview's name and description no longer hide theirs separately. Replaces the `appearance` of [D-163], [D-170] and [D-177].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-5.1]
```

```mdl
decision D-184: An override's presentation applies to its field alone, so an object's or an array's nested fields keep the form's layout. `section` on a field other than an array shows it as `compact`. Fills in [D-183].
  date: 2026-11-03
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-5.1]
  why: An array shown as a section holds rows that are ordinary fields, and a section has no meaning for a scalar, whose label and control `compact` already show.
```

```mdl
decision D-185: plugin-code, not plugin-claude, renders a project's repositories, in the overview's Software group, and plugin-claude adds only the code folder there. Replaces the plugin-claude rendering of [D-155].
