  by: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-5.6]
```

```mdl
decision D-186: `Project.status` stays optional, so a project made without one, or migrated without one, shows an empty pill until a status is picked. The pill offers no "None", so a status once picked is never cleared. Corrects the rationale of [D-169].
