```mdl
decision D-193: `TaskList.Editor` lays the create row on the list's columns only when it is `inline`, which the chat passes; otherwise it stacks the title and description above labelled tags. `DEFAULT_COLUMNS` has no estimate column, so the project list shows a set estimate as muted text beside its artifacts, and a list that names an estimate column, as the chat's does, shows the estimate field there instead. Fills in [D-192].
