```mdl
decision D-195: react-ui's `Tag` takes `variant: 'outline'`, which draws the tag's hue as a ring in its border colour and text in its text colour, on no fill; a `Select` trigger rendered as a tag and the stacked create row's assignee tag use it. Fills in [D-194].
  date: 2026-11-04
